<p>The <strong class="selflink">engineevents 2da</strong> defines the game engine <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Event%20keyword" title="Event keyword">events</a> that are exposed to the scripting engine, and controls whether they are routed to a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script" title="Script">script</a>, for example <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Rules%20core" title="Rules core (page does not exist)">rules_core</a>, or to a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Resource%20keyword" title="Resource">resource</a>, for example a creature.
</p><p>This <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is defined as an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> in the<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da"> M2DA_base 2da</a> and has an <b>ID</b> of <b>114</b>. It can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with <b>engineevents</b>. It can be referenced in scripting using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_EVENTS</a> constant defined in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2da%20constants%20h" title="2da constants h">2da_constants_h</a>. 
</p>
